<title>FRANCE: BMW interested in building UK engine plant.</title>
<headline>BMW interested in building UK engine plant.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Motoren Werke AG chairman Bernd Pietschetrieder confirmed reports that the company was considering building a car engine in Britain, but said no decision had been made on the new plant.</p>
<p>&quot;I favour making this engine in the UK provided we get the subsidies,&quot; he told reporters at a news conference at the International Automobile Salon in Paris.</p>
<p>BMW would build the engine in Britain alone, he said, adding that it would not involve Chrysler.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
